{"words": [{"text": "إِنَّ", "translation": "Indeed"}, {"text": "هَـٰذَا", "translation": "this"}, {"text": "لَهُوَ", "translation": "surely it (is)"}, {"text": "ٱلْقَصَصُ", "translation": "the narration "}, {"text": "ٱلْحَقُّ ۚ", "translation": "[the] true"}, {"text": "وَمَا", "translation": "And (there is) no"}, {"text": "مِنْ", "translation": "(of)"}, {"text": "إِلَـٰهٍ", "translation": "god"}, {"text": "إِلَّا", "translation": "except"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ ۚ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "وَإِنَّ", "translation": "And indeed"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "لَهُوَ", "translation": "surely He"}, {"text": "ٱلْعَزِيزُ", "translation": "(is) the All-Mighty"}, {"text": "ٱلْحَكِيمُ", "translation": "the All-Wise"}], "sahih": "Indeed, this is the true narration. And there is no deity except Allāh. And indeed, Allāh is the Exalted in Might, the Wise."}